-- "Pierscien Anty-Exp" (40002, sold in the ItemShop, never used up): the level
-- lock a player asked for (Iwakura's ItemShop thread, 26 September). Its use
-- switches AFFECT_EXP_BLOCK (310) on and off - the affect the engine honours
-- wherever it hands out experience, and the one the bots' own level lock is
-- (ManagePlayerBotExpLock); the client shows its icon, and a right click on it
-- takes it off (the stock affect_remove.quest). The ring was the package's
-- unused "Pierscien Levi" (migratorify.py renames it). Bots never come here.
quest antiexp_ring begin
    state start begin
        when 40002.use begin
            if pc.has_affect(310) then
                affect.remove_new(310)
                syschat("Pierscien Anty-Exp: doswiadczenie znowu wlaczone.")
            else
                affect.add_new(310, 0, 0, 60 * 365 * 24 * 3600, 0, true)
                syschat("Pierscien Anty-Exp: nie dostajesz doswiadczenia (uzyj ponownie, by wlaczyc).")
            end
        end
    end
end
